<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for <%= businessName %> — Learn how we protect your personal information, consultation records, and enquiry details.">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome -->
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Stylesheets -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body class="site-body">
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>

    <!-- Page Banner -->
    <section class="page-banner">
        <div class="container page-banner-inner">
            <span class="page-tag"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-gold"></i> DATA SECURITY & PRIVACY</span>
            <h1 class="page-title">Privacy <span class="gold-gradient-text">Policy</span></h1>
            <p class="page-subtitle">Your trust is our paramount asset. Here is how <%= businessName %> safeguards your personal information and property enquiry records.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Policy Content Section -->
    <section class="section" style="padding: 60px 0;">
        <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.8;">
            <div style="background: rgba(18, 24, 38, 0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 36px 40px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                <h2 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-gold"></i> 1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>When you submit an enquiry form, schedule a site visit, or contact us through WhatsApp, telephone, or email, we collect relevant details including your full name, phone number, email address, preferred property category (villas, plots, apartments, commercial), budget range, and consultation notes.</p>

                <h2 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-gold"></i> 2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>Your details are used exclusively for legitimate real estate business communication:</p>
                <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 12px 0;">
                    <li>Coordinating property site visits, brochure distribution, and video walkthroughs.</li>
                    <li>Providing accurate legal scrutiny records, layout approvals, and title documentation.</li>
                    <li>Contacting you with updates regarding property availability and scheduled appointments.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><i class="fas fa-lock text-gold"></i> 3. Data Protection & Sharing</h2>
                <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information with third-party marketers or advertisers. Access to your contact records is restricted to verified SV Real Estates advisors and CRM personnel under strict confidentiality agreements.</p>

                <h2 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt text-gold"></i> 4. Contact Us Regarding Your Privacy</h2>
                <p>If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to have your contact details updated or removed from our enquiry database, please reach out directly:</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <strong>Office:</strong> <%= typeof businessAddress !== 'undefined' ? businessAddress : '# MIG-2/183, 9th Phase, KPHB Colony, Kukatpally, Hyderabad - 500085' %><br>
                    <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:<%= businessPhone %>" style="color: var(--gold);"><%= businessPhone %></a><br>
                    <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:<%= businessEmail %>" style="color: var(--gold);"><%= businessEmail %></a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
